# Dataset Description

## Input Video Dataset

The system accepts surveillance videos collected from traffic cameras.

Format:

* MP4
* AVI
* MOV

Example:

aabb.mp4

## Query Vehicle Dataset

A query image is provided to identify a specific vehicle.

Example:

redr.jpg

## Generated Dataset

During execution the system automatically generates:

* Detected vehicle crops
* Vehicle snapshots
* Matching vehicle images

These images are stored inside:

datasets/detected_vehicles/

## Supported Vehicle Categories

* Car
* Truck
* Bus

## Annotation Source

Vehicle classes are detected using the COCO Dataset labels through YOLOv3.
